{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the depths of Bog\u2019s Tower in this <strong>Deckbuilding Roguelike</strong>, where every run is randomly generated and filled with enemies that embody the struggles of the modern age</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570180/extras/cherub_banner.png?t=1742306720\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Deckbuilding Chaos</strong> \u2013 Choose your cards with care! As you embark on your journey, you'll encounter a vast array of cards to enhance your deck with each new challenge.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Packed Combat</strong> \u2013 Face off against caricatures of the modern world, each presenting unique challenges.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Vill you eat ze bugs?</strong>\u2013 Descend into the randomly generated depths of Lord Bog's Dungeon, encountering  events which choices will either help or hinder you on your journey.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570180/extras/BANNER2.gif?t=1742306720\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Coal or Gems?</strong> \u2013 Scattered throughout the extraordinary dungeon lie powerful items. These items can dramatically amplify the strength of your deck, offering game-changing synergies and interactions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3570180/extras/223.png?t=1742306720\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Frens - </strong>As you journey through the depths of the dungeon, you\u2019ll encounter allies willing to join your cause\u2014each bringing unique abilities, passive buffs, or tactical advantages.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"